        "TileImage": "$($repository a32f37e7-ccce-4866-b773-bde021d79df4).Image",
        "Description": "Mabaya Mzabuni, better known as &quot;the diddler&quot;, is attending the IAGO auction. However, his real motif is to approach high value individuals and invite them to a private party of his own. Two members of the auction&apos;s security have compromised their positions to enable it, by controling access, redirecting attention, and ensuring compliance. Once the invitation is extended, It will not be optional. The arrangement must end here agent 47. Good luck.",
